<div style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px; color: #1e293b;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 18px; margin: 0 0 16px;">Your verification code</h2>
    <p style="margin: 0 0 16px; line-height: 1.5;">
        Use this code to finish signing in. It expires soon and can be used once.
    </p>
    <p style="margin: 0 0 24px;">
        <span style="display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background: #f1f5f9; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 8px;">{{ code }}</span>
    </p>
    <p style="margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8;">
        If you did not try to sign in, someone may be using your password. Change it soon.
    </p>
    <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; margin: 16px 0;">
    <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.6;">
        Requested {{ date }} from IP {{ ipAddress }}<br>
        {{ userAgent }}
    </p>
</div>
